 "description": "Law2020 - SIR model of COVID-19 transmission in Malyasia with time-varying parameters\nBioModels BIOMD0000000982 (curated). SBML file: Law2020.xml.\nSimulation: 0 to 53 time units (SED-ML: Law2020.sedml), sampling 0.6625.\nRun switches: -ig:mass -INT:1 -obeymaxint\nVerification against libRoadRunner (SBML reference): PASS, max |difference| = 2.07e-06 of species peak (worst: Infected)\nSBML time units are used unchanged as Kintecus seconds.\nConversion notes:\n  [info] Susceptible_to_Infected: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed",
